L001442	The pulse generator is designed to produce performant pulses at a maximum pulse repetition frequency (PRF) of 41.67~MHz.
L001443	Pulse width is tunable from 0.4 to 6~ns with approximately picosecond resolution across the full range and with sub-picosecond resolution below 4~ns.
L001444	Figure~\ref{figS8} plots measurements of the output pulse width step-size as a function of set pulse width.
