L001874	\subsection{Automation}\label{automation}
L001875	
L001876	While a simplified tune-up workflow is illustrated in \figref{figS21}, in practice a tree data structure records the complete sequence of actions performed during a fully automated tune-up run.
L001877	Each node in this automation tree is an action taken (i.e.  data collection, analysis, decision logic, etc.) and a depth-first traversal indicates the total ordering of actions.
