L002480			Each block in the signal chain represents a	discrete SPICE component model that has been developed to model the specific electrical characteristics of that component.
L002481			These component	models are obtained by applying a variety computational electromagnetic	techniques and lumped-element equivalent models.
L002482			A custom-developed python interface allows the users to easily specific the nets of interest, generate SPICE netlists for each component, and chain the components together to simulate the end-to-end integrated system.
