L002767	In \figref{figS42} we compare simulated and experimental performance of the distance-3 repetition code, using both the event simulator and the spin simulator.
L002768	A first-order (linear) attribution is performed via the spin simulator by simulating the repetition code under the influence of only a single noise source at a time.
